# gen.ninja sets up $cl and $clang and immediately invokes this.
# Note that we DO NOT have a 'build.ninja' since we expect to run from cd w32cross/.
# We can't parameterize tool names.
# So instead we reuse the *same* tool names and use subninja to keep them isolated.
# By the way, this goes against, like, the entire Ninja philosophy?

subninja tests/02cl.ninja
subninja tests/02clang.ninja
